{"2927840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vedmaak", "steam_appid": 2927840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game has now been fully updated to the latest version.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly appointed Vedmaak, an elite bounty hunter skilled in melee combat, marksmanship, and practical magic, you arrive in the troubled town of Vrangrad. Strange creatures threaten the surrounding lands, and your task is simple—fight, survive, earn coin, and grow stronger. Your adventure begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world, battle dangerous enemies in turn-based combat, collect valuable loot, and become stronger with every fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee, ranged, and magic combat</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br>AI Disclosure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-assisted tools were used during the development of certain game assets. All AI-generated content was reviewed, edited, and integrated into the game by the developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mature Content Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains fantasy violence, including combat against human and non-human enemies. There is no graphic gore or realistic depictions of violence.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game has now been fully updated to the latest version.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly a